2. **"the fingerprint boundary still trusts provider-controlled `GateFailure`"** (you reproduced
   `main_status=0`) — fixed, then re-fixed three times as successive rounds found further dunders:
   `__name__` via a metaclass, `__repr__` in a formatter, `__eq__` on an int subclass,
   `__hash__`/`__str__` on a str subclass. Patching them one at a time could not terminate, so the
